<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47349" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tăbŭlāris</span></b> ,
		e, adj.
		tabula, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>relating to boards</i>
			of wood or <i>plates</i> of metal. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			Adj. (post-Aug. and very rare): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aeris temperatura statuaria eademque tabularia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					34, 9, 20, § 97</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">clavus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Petr. 75</span></i>
			. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Substt.</i> * </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tăbŭlārĭa</span></b> ,
				ĭum, n., <i>plates</i>, <i><span class="en">Sen. Ira, 3, 19, 1</span></i>. —
			* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> Tabulare
			palati, <i>the roof of the mouth</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Veg. Vet. 2, 11 <i>fin.</i></span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
